  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A mass M oscillates with a period <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> when connected to a spring with spring stiffness constant k. A mass of 2M is connected to 2 identical springs, each with spring stiffness constant k.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the period of the system?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{4}\"></span></li></ol>"
